# ⚠️ Common GATE Traps

### Trap 1

SSTF may cause **starvation**.

### Trap 2

SCAN goes to the **disk end**, LOOK goes only to the **last request**.

### Trap 3

C-SCAN provides more **uniform waiting time** than SCAN.

### Trap 4

Contiguous allocation suffers from **external fragmentation**.

### Trap 5

Indexed allocation supports efficient **direct/random access**.

